-  <style>
-    /* ---------- Colours ----------
-       From the shared i360 theme (light = the i360إ app's look; sepia and
-       dark = the Reader's own); the theme is <html data-theme="…">. The names
-       below are the Reader's own, kept so the rest of this file is unchanged.
-       The desk behind the pages is the theme's frame colour. */
